			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1794648190079,
			"created": 1794639675713,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Distributed Key-Value Store System",
			"fontSize": 49,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Distributed Key-Value Store System",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "JYvckxjt",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 128.02365794932064,
			"y": 449.8099332742065,
			"width": 380.7431640625,
			"height": 403.125,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"gkPEVRyI-guK07dQWmybv"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b11V",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1758227109,
			"version": 628,
			"versionNonce": 517345025,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1794648190079,
			"created": 1794639696471,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Functional requirements\n1) GET(key) -> value / not found\n2) PUT(key, value, ttl?)\n3) DELETE(key) -> tombstone\n\nOptional: TTL, conditional writes\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- Availability: 99.99% target\n- GET p99 < 10 ms (same region)\n- Horizontal scalability; durability\n- Eventual consistency is acceptable\n\nClarify: QPS, read/write ratio,\nvalue size, storage growth",
			"fontSize": 21.5,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Functional requirements\n1) GET(key) -> value / not found\n2) PUT(key, value, ttl?)\n3) DELETE(key) -> tombstone\n\nOptional: TTL, conditional writes\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- Availability: 99.99% target\n- GET p99 < 10 ms (same region)\n- Horizontal scalability; durability\n- Eventual consistency is acceptable\n\nClarify: QPS, read/write ratio,\nvalue size, storage growth",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "QqDFIuYn",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 591.3239753375151,
			"y": 476.2189004149282,
			"width": 309.23187255859375,
			"height": 82.5,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
