			"text": "LSM Tree",
			"fontSize": 53.637515513580354,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "LSM Tree",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "Y1JiWCkF",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 76.32399456189046,
			"y": 1406.9672509485447,
			"width": 440.816650390625,
			"height": 146.25,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "dotted",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"Y_bcz2EXrVUMsxwDMP9yf"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b23",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 8145971,
			"version": 455,
			"versionNonce": 507635005,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1794648190079,
			"created": 1794640454204,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Write-ahead log (WAL)\n- Append every mutation before write ACK.\n- Durable ACK requires fsync (or equivalent).\n- Replay WAL after crash/restart.\n- Sequential append favors write throughput.\n- Protects data not yet flushed to SSTables.",
			"fontSize": 19.5,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Write-ahead log (WAL)\n- Append every mutation before write ACK.\n- Durable ACK requires fsync (or equivalent).\n- Replay WAL after crash/restart.\n- Sequential append favors write throughput.\n- Protects data not yet flushed to SSTables.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "nv9mhYT6",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 584.7981564962435,
			"y": 1396.700066280351,
			"width": 422.3696594238281,
			"height": 146.25,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "dotted",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"Y_bcz2EXrVUMsxwDMP9yf"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b24",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 893477405,
			"version": 384,
			"versionNonce": 923151577,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1794648190079,
			"created": 1794640533570,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Memtable\n- Ordered in-memory structure (skip list\n  or balanced tree), not necessarily RB tree.\n- Holds recent writes and tombstones.\n- Fast lookup; flushes at size threshold.\n- WAL first, then update memtable.",
			"fontSize": 19.5,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Memtable\n- Ordered in-memory structure (skip list\n  or balanced tree), not necessarily RB tree.\n- Holds recent writes and tombstones.\n- Fast lookup; flushes at size threshold.\n- WAL first, then update memtable.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "ADVKvn6N",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 75.69123877027016,
			"y": 1618.0044943172875,
			"width": 416.142822265625,
			"height": 144.75,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "dotted",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"Y_bcz2EXrVUMsxwDMP9yf"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b25",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 2030960541,
			"version": 466,
			"versionNonce": 2085767682,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1794648190079,
			"created": 1794640598173,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "SSTables (sorted, immutable)\n- Flush sorted memtable to SSTable files.\n- Data blocks, sparse index and metadata.\n- GET checks memtable / cache / SSTables.\n- Sequential disk I/O suits bulk writes.\n- Many files increase read amplification.",
			"fontSize": 19.3,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "SSTables (sorted, immutable)\n- Flush sorted memtable to SSTable files.\n- Data blocks, sparse index and metadata.\n- GET checks memtable / cache / SSTables.\n- Sequential disk I/O suits bulk writes.\n- Many files increase read amplification.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "iqDl2gEC",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 591.5970230492998,
			"y": 1618.0044943172875,
			"width": 462.380859375,
			"height": 96.5,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
