			"text": "Distributed-systems deep dive",
			"fontSize": 33,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Distributed-systems deep dive",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "WEmhjAsO",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1139,
			"y": 627,
			"width": 458.04,
			"height": 316.875,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "dotted",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"fI8bJRHKp1FRFDECA_JNj"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b29",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 313336947,
			"version": 978,
			"versionNonce": 276945312,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1794648190079,
			"created": 1794640848178,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "1) Partitioning & replication\n- Hash(key) maps to a token on the ring.\n- Virtual nodes balance placement and load.\n- Join/leave: stream affected token ranges.\n\nLeaderless replication (Dynamo-style)\n- Coordinator fans out to N=3 replicas.\n- Place copies across availability zones.\n- No leader election on the write path.\n- Background repair handles stale replicas.\n\nTrade-off: quorum overlap helps reads find\nnewer values; not a linearizability proof.",
			"fontSize": 19.5,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "1) Partitioning & replication\n- Hash(key) maps to a token on the ring.\n- Virtual nodes balance placement and load.\n- Join/leave: stream affected token ranges.\n\nLeaderless replication (Dynamo-style)\n- Coordinator fans out to N=3 replicas.\n- Place copies across availability zones.\n- No leader election on the write path.\n- Background repair handles stale replicas.\n\nTrade-off: quorum overlap helps reads find\nnewer values; not a linearizability proof.",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "7TeK7Jty",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1142,
			"y": 974,
			"width": 476.694091796875,
			"height": 265.375,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "dotted",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"9x3dPA1X2BESfgbZcwr4N",
				"fI8bJRHKp1FRFDECA_JNj"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b2A",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 246844883,
			"version": 743,
			"versionNonce": 1067705924,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1794648190079,
			"created": 1794641052555,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "2) Quorum: N=3, W=2, R=2\n- PUT returns after 2 durable replica ACKs.\n- GET waits for 2 responses; reconciles versions.\n- R + W > N => overlap for fixed replica sets.\n- Overlap alone does NOT guarantee linearizability.\n- Lower R/W can improve latency, but changes\n  consistency, durability or availability trade-offs.\n- Sloppy quorum can weaken strict overlap.\n- Fewer than W reachable? Strict write fails.\n- fsync-before-ACK vs page-cache ACK directly\n  affects durability and write tail latency.",
			"fontSize": 19.3,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "2) Quorum: N=3, W=2, R=2\n- PUT returns after 2 durable replica ACKs.\n- GET waits for 2 responses; reconciles versions.\n- R + W > N => overlap for fixed replica sets.\n- Overlap alone does NOT guarantee linearizability.\n- Lower R/W can improve latency, but changes\n  consistency, durability or availability trade-offs.\n- Sloppy quorum can weaken strict overlap.\n- Fewer than W reachable? Strict write fails.\n- fsync-before-ACK vs page-cache ACK directly\n  affects durability and write tail latency.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "oxJUGc3t",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1139,
			"y": 1270,
			"width": 490.6940612792969,
			"height": 312,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "dotted",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"9x3dPA1X2BESfgbZcwr4N",
				"fI8bJRHKp1FRFDECA_JNj"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b2B",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 825547027,
			"version": 1048,
			"versionNonce": 52738352,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1794648190079,
			"created": 1794641198376,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "3) Failure, divergence & repair\n- A+B ACK a write; if A fails, B retains it.\n- GET from B+C can reconcile stale C.\n- Read repair / anti-entropy sync stale copies.\n- Hinted handoff can help temporary outages.\n- Gossip spreads node health/membership info.\n- Strict quorum rejects PUT if < W replicas respond.\n\nConcurrent writes and deletion\n- Vector clocks show causality/concurrency;\n  they do NOT automatically pick a latest value.\n- Last-write-wins is simple but may lose updates.\n- Tombstones need safe retention before cleanup.",
			"fontSize": 19.2,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "3) Failure, divergence & repair\n- A+B ACK a write; if A fails, B retains it.\n- GET from B+C can reconcile stale C.\n- Read repair / anti-entropy sync stale copies.\n- Hinted handoff can help temporary outages.\n- Gossip spreads node health/membership info.\n- Strict quorum rejects PUT if < W replicas respond.\n\nConcurrent writes and deletion\n- Vector clocks show causality/concurrency;\n  they do NOT automatically pick a latest value.\n- Last-write-wins is simple but may lose updates.\n- Tombstones need safe retention before cleanup.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
