		},
		{
			"id": "P70yueRR",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1071,
			"y": 2550,
			"width": 459.63018798828125,
			"height": 307.5,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e293b",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "c02cQ",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 639029719,
			"version": 1,
			"versionNonce": 615615602,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1794648190079,
			"created": 1794648190079,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- YCSB / workload replay: realistic QPS,\n  key-value sizes, read/write mix, hot keys.\n- Record p50, p95, p99, failures, CPU, disk,\n  queueing, cache hits, compaction stalls.\n- Test normal load, peak, + one node failure,\n  and zone interruption / recovery.\n- If p99 > 10 ms: inspect RPC, queueing,\n  storage stalls, replica stragglers and skew.\n- Quorum latency waits for the Rth/Wth ACK.\n- Cross-region traffic may not fit this SLO.\n\nOnly benchmark data can validate the goal.",
			"fontSize": 20.5,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "- YCSB / workload replay: realistic QPS,\n  key-value sizes, read/write mix, hot keys.\n- Record p50, p95, p99, failures, CPU, disk,\n  queueing, cache hits, compaction stalls.\n- Test normal load, peak, + one node failure,\n  and zone interruption / recovery.\n- If p99 > 10 ms: inspect RPC, queueing,\n  storage stalls, replica stragglers and skew.\n- Quorum latency waits for the Rth/Wth ACK.\n- Cross-region traffic may not fit this SLO.\n\nOnly benchmark data can validate the goal.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
